Cripples the target's mind, inflicting [90, 121, 145, 165, 183 (TL1-5; MP 100)] mind damage and reducing its Mental Save by [8, 12, 14, 16, 18 (TL1-5; MP 100)] for 4 turns.  This attack always hits, and the mental save reduction stacks.

Against brainlocked targets, the damage and Mental Save reduction will be doubled.

The damage and save reduction will scale with your Mindpower.
